{
	"_readme": [
		"Display Delight placed blocks for foods Display Delight 1.2.0 has none for (compat/DisplayDelightDishes,",
		"feature_writeup/placeable_food.md). One block creativeengineering:<block> per entry, linked to its item on server",
		"world load. dish: bowl (Display Delight's bowl with a food surface cut from the item sprite) or plate (the item",
		"sprite laid flat on Display Delight's food plate). crop: the sprite area [u1, v1, u2, v2] used as the bowl's food",
		"surface. After editing, run python3 tools/gen_dd_dishes.py (blockstates, models, loot tables, tag, lang) and",
		"rebuild patcherMod.",
		"requires: a mod the food needs; without it the block is not registered, and the loot table lives in",
		"packs/mods/<mod>/data/creativedelight/loot_tables/blocks/ (added only with that mod; 2026-11-14)."
	],
